    "sub_ename": "COLOR & DISPLAY MEASUREMENT TECHNOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程為銜接色彩工程學課程，介紹色彩及影像分析方法與量測原理，並搭配色彩科學與工程中的量測實例進行講授。本課程將進行實務操作，並學習分析方法。",
    "describe_eh": "This course continues Color Engineering, introducing the analysis methods and measurement principles of color and images. Examples of measurements in color science and engineering are also included. Practical operations and analytical methods are studied throughout the course.",
